OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty of murdering his       
OL,4,Aex-colleague                           
OL,6,FThe 29-year-old of Blackford Road,     
OL,7,FBirmingham, launched the attack while  
OL,8,Fhis victim was on a WhatsApp call to   
OL,9,Fhis wife in Pakistan. He is due to be  
OL,10,Fsentenced on Monday.                   
